@baseUrl = https://api.isthereanydeal.com
@apiKey = {{$dotenv ITAD_API_KEY}}

### Search for a game by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/search/v1?key={{apiKey}}&title=Wild%20Hunt

### Get game info by ITAD ID (exact-ID lookup, also returns appid for Steam backfill)
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/info/v2?key={{apiKey}}&id=018d937f-1ae9-734c-ba47-bd357cf07edd

### Get active bundles containing a game (used by the "Bundles" button, backlog)
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/bundles/v2?key={{apiKey}}&id=018d937e-e9db-717a-baeb-62a6513d146c

### Lookup exact match by Steam appid
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/lookup/v1?key={{apiKey}}&appid=367520

### Best current deals
GET {{baseUrl}}/deals/v2?key={{apiKey}}

### Best current deals (US)
GET {{baseUrl}}/deals/v2?key={{apiKey}}&country=US

### Top 20 deals
GET {{baseUrl}}/deals/v2?key={{apiKey}}&limit=20

### Batch prices — POST with JSON body
POST {{baseUrl}}/games/prices/v3?key={{apiKey}}
