### === Recon: new endpoints, 2026-08-11 ===

### Global bundle list — no game ID needed, sidesteps per-game sparsity
GET {{baseUrl}}/bundles/v1?key={{apiKey}}&limit=10

### Global bundle list — including expired, to see what a "finished" bundle looks like
GET {{baseUrl}}/bundles/v1?key={{apiKey}}&limit=5&expired=true

### Price overview (batched) — best price + historyLow + active bundles, all in one call
POST {{baseUrl}}/games/overview/v2?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "018d937f-1ae9-734c-ba47-bd357cf07edd",
  "018d937f-6136-71e4-a7d4-088a2e8f58ad"
]

### Game subscriptions — is this game in Game Pass / EA Play / etc?
POST {{baseUrl}}/games/subs/v1?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "018d937f-1f0a-73a6-a3aa-b861902b50a6"
]

### Price history log — full log, default last 3 months
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/history/v2?key={{apiKey}}&id=018d937f-1ae9-734c-ba47-bd357cf07edd

### Price history log — explicit since, further back than the 3-month default
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/history/v2?key={{apiKey}}&id=018d937f-1ae9-734c-ba47-bd357cf07edd&since=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z

### Per-store historical low (vs. the single cross-store historyLow you already cache)
POST {{baseUrl}}/games/storelow/v2?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

