### Top current deals, biggest discount first — candidate for /top-deals
GET {{baseUrl}}/deals/v2?key={{apiKey}}&sort=-cut&limit=10

### Top current deals, US-scoped
GET {{baseUrl}}/deals/v2?key={{apiKey}}&country=US&sort=-cut&limit=10

### Bundles sorted — testing likely sort values
GET {{baseUrl}}/bundles/v1?key={{apiKey}}&limit=10&sort=-expiry

### Does the active bundle count exceed one page?
GET {{baseUrl}}/bundles/v1?key={{apiKey}}&limit=10&offset=10&sort=-expiry